<title>PORTUGAL: No bids placed at Portugal 10-yr bond auction.</title>
<headline>No bids placed at Portugal 10-yr bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-03-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal's Institute of Public Credit Management (IGCP) said no 10-year bonds were placed at today's auction.</p>
<p>The average bidding at the last such sale on February 14 was 6.699 percent.</p>
</text>
